# Taking control of a turret: the eyes go to the turret's view on a screen, A and B zoom while held, and holding Y gets
# out. The Gatling Turret 1 that Earth Planet's EarthEasyStation carries (owned by the player).
plugin SpaceEngineersVR
world game:Earth Planet

# ---- Setup: stand at the turret and take its control (the terminal's Control action, a setup step) ----------------------
admin creativeTools
# Earth Planet's station belongs to the world's own identity: the game lets the player use it once they own it
own EarthEasyStation
# a turret is taken only through an antenna, and the station's is off
switch Antenna on
goto "Gatling Turret 1" 6
wait 2
log SpaceEngineersVR.log
expect session focused within 60
head 0 1.6 0
wait 1
read character
expect controlledEntity == null
# the turret's Control button in the terminal
control Gatling Turret 1 on EarthEasyStation
wait 2
expect log VR controls: turret ( within 5
expect log Forced view: on (the view is a turret within 5

# ---- A zooms in while held, B zooms out ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
press right a
wait 1
expect log Turret: A / B: zoom in (CAMERA_ZOOM_IN) held within 5
release right a
wait 0.5
expect log Turret: A / B: zoom let go within 5
press right b
wait 1
expect log Turret: A / B: zoom out (CAMERA_ZOOM_OUT) held within 5
release right b
wait 0.5

# ---- Hold Y to let go of the turret ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
press left b
wait 0.8
release left b
wait 2
expect log Forced view: over within 5
expect log VR controls: on foot within 5
read character
expect controlledEntity == null
